# The Weekly Challenge 266 - Lubos Kolouch

Solutions for Task 1 (Uncommon Words) and Task 2 (X Matrix) in Perl and Python.

## Task 1: Uncommon Words
- Given two sentences, `$line1` and `$line2`.
- Find all words that appear exactly once in one sentence and do not appear in the other.
- Return `('')` if none found.

## Task 2: X Matrix
- Given a square matrix `$matrix`.
- Determine if all elements on the diagonals (main and anti-diagonal) are non-zero and all other elements are 0.
